              "name": "text",
              "settings": {
                "textarea_or_richtext": "textarea",
                "text": "Another advantage of oval diamond engagement rings is their versatile style. The elongated shape of the oval cut is flattering on any finger, creating the illusion of length and slenderness. This makes oval engagement rings an excellent choice for those with shorter fingers or wider hands. Additionally, oval diamonds have a larger surface area than round diamonds of the same carat weight, giving the impression of a more substantial stone.",
